# Maggot King kills on the trip plaque: the trip starts with the boss in sight, each kill is counted
# once from the game's own kill count or the chat line, whichever comes first, the take-eggs roll
# that gives nothing is logged as that kill's loot, and the pet's message joins the kill it follows.
# A kill left unlooted is logged without loot when the next one begins or the trip ends. Nothing on
# the plaque moves during a fight: no eat or drink reminders, no supplies countdown, no fight cues.
# Schematic, not the real map: the fight is in an instance, so the scene only holds the boss.
# Facts: NpcID.MAGGOT_KING (15742) and VarPlayerID.TOTAL_MAGGOT_KING_KILLS (5614) are RuneLite
# gameval (that the varp is the kill count is read from its name, unconfirmed); "The eggs pop as
# you try to take them." and "You have a funny feeling like you're being followed." are the wiki's
# (oldschool.runescape.wiki, Maggot King and Maggot marquess); the kill count line is unconfirmed
# for the Maggot King (source: the form core/Chat reads for every boss).
scene 3200 3200
skill ATTACK 90
skill STRENGTH 90
skill MAGIC 95
skill HITPOINTS 99
skill PRAYER 77
item SHARK "Shark"
items INV SHARK 10
varp TOTAL_MAGGOT_KING_KILLS 40
at 3230 3230
login
npc MAGGOT_KING "Maggot King" 3234 3234 5 level 741 as king
watch over tripPlaque.shown.over
watch title tripPlaque.shown.title
watch line0 tripPlaque.shown.lines.0.text
watch line1 tripPlaque.shown.lines.1.text
watch line2 tripPlaque.shown.lines.2.text
watch right2 tripPlaque.shown.lines.2.right
watch line3 tripPlaque.shown.lines.3.text
watch right3 tripPlaque.shown.lines.3.right
never line1 ~ "Eat"
never line1 ~ "Drink"
never line2 ~ "more kill"
never line1 ~ "pray"
tick 2
expect over = "BOSS PILOT: ON A TRIP"
expect title = "Maggot King"
expect line0 ~ "0 kills in"
expect line1 = "Your first logged kill is next"

# Low hitpoints mid-fight: nothing speaks.
boost HITPOINTS 12
tick 3
expect line1 = "Your first logged kill is next"

# The first kill: the game's own count rises, then the chat line of the same kill is not a second.
varp TOTAL_MAGGOT_KING_KILLS 41
tick
chat GAMEMESSAGE "Your Maggot King kill count is: 41."
tick
expect line0 ~ "1 kill in"
chat GAMEMESSAGE "The eggs pop as you try to take them."
tick 3
expect saved.maggotKingV1 ~ :41,           # the kill count, saved: "kc":41
expect saved.maggotKingV1 ~ EGGS
expect line1 = "Last loot: eggs, nothing"
expect line2 = "Elder fang: only from the stomach"

# The second, from the chat line first, with the pet's message: it joins that kill.
boost HITPOINTS 99
chat GAMEMESSAGE "Your Maggot King kill count is: 42."
tick
varp TOTAL_MAGGOT_KING_KILLS 42
chat GAMEMESSAGE "You have a funny feeling like you're being followed."
tick 100
expect line0 ~ "2 kills in"

# The third begins before the second was looted: the second is logged, unlooted, with its pet, and timed
# back to back. The kill times line (kill to kill) comes first once there are two kills.
chat GAMEMESSAGE "Your Maggot King kill count is: 43."
tick
expect line0 ~ "3 kills in"
expect saved.maggotKingV1 ~ :42,           # the kill count, saved: "kc":42
expect saved.maggotKingV1 ~ PET
expect line1 ~ "Last "
expect line2 = "Last kill: not looted"
expect line3 = "Your last kill brought Maggot marquess!"
expect right2 ~ "kills/hr"

# Logging out ends the trip and logs the third kill as it stands.
state LOGIN_SCREEN
tick
expect title = null
expect saved.maggotKingV1 ~ :43,           # the kill count, saved: "kc":43
